```

## 3) How to use

- Validate in Node with `ajv`:
  ```bash
  npm i ajv ajv-formats
  ```
  ```js
  import Ajv from "ajv";
  import addFormats from "ajv-formats";
  import schema from "./agent-integration-profile.nested.json" assert { type: "json" };

  const ajv = new Ajv({ allErrors: true, strict: true });
  addFormats(ajv);
  const validate = ajv.compile(schema);
  const ok = validate(agentJson);
  if (!ok) console.error(validate.errors);
  ```

- For CSV: parse each row to an object, then validate with the **flat** schema.


[^1]: [Automate AI Workflows with OpenAPI to Build LLM-Ready APIs](https://www.gravitee.io/blog/ai-workflows-with-openapi-and-llm-apis) (64%)
[^2]: [How to Make Your API Agent-Ready: Design Principles for the AI Age](https://apidog.com/blog/make-api-agent-ready/) (36%)

